          "highlight": [
            "waived"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "客戶說明帳單錯誤後，銀行免除了延遲付款的罰金。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "By waiving the inspection clause, the buyer accepted the property in its current condition.",
          "highlight": [
            "waiving"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "買方放棄查驗條款，即接受該房產現況。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
        "relinquish",
        "forgo",
        "excuse"
      ],
      "antonyms": [
